  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gekano Girls Sec School Water collection project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partner: St. Theresa&#x2019;s Gekano Girls Project Title: &#x2018;Renovating water pump and improving water collection to sustain the Girls&#x2019; Activities: Project Objective: To renovate an old pump and buy water tanks for water harvesting to maintain clean water supply for girls. The pump will provide water during sunny season while the tanks will help to store water and making it available in all the places for general cleaning and hand washing to reduce the spread of COVID-19 as per the requirement of Ministry of health and WHO.  Activities: Water testing, Pipe tracing, piping and wiring, Pump installation, Building fetch and hand washing point, Tank installation, Guttering and testing the pump</narrative>
  </description>
